        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.2": "监控、分析、规划、执行，基于共享的知识：自主计算的控制循环。Kephart 与 Chess，《自主计算的愿景》（“The Vision of Autonomic Computing”），IEEE Computer，2003。",
  "@home.design.notes.2": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 2.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;rFxIq0l51tJPVHFRVe7cPSuVKgUi-KNeAT5TmBxbe88",
