          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.3": "灰度管理：与华为创始人任正非相关的管理哲学，以对模糊与妥协的包容来治理，而不是作非黑即白的裁决。在这里，它塑造了外壳，即每个单元所保持的边界。",
  "@home.design.notes.3": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 3.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;1LF6LzMtihwCUO3bKd74hOTQYKFmtC_rzuHksjBjOn0",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.4": "人单合一：张瑞敏于 2005 年在海尔提出的模式，它把企业变成一个由自治的微型企业组成的网络，每个微型企业直接对自己的客户负责。",
  "@home.design.notes.4": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 4.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;wj4k40Ho4Ee0M_sMJcSqPJZST5J2LBWZeEVSqwKJIrI",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.5": "集合城市是指若干原本分离的城镇发展成一座连续城市的区域（帕特里克·格迪斯，《进化中的城市》，1915）。在这里：彼此分别问责的节点，生长为一张服务织物。",
  "@home.design.notes.5": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 5.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;EfDaJWJUdLMHlnGVYaCkwvwaOvxGq7SuRXfSXpcafZ0",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.6": "一种矛盾并不推出一切的逻辑。相互冲突的记录被并列保存，而不是被覆盖。Belnap，《一种有用的四值逻辑》（“A Useful Four-Valued Logic”），1977：告知为真、告知为假、告知皆是、告知皆非。",
  "@home.design.notes.6": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 6.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;AWfSwzpAMw8YQZRx12N6tImIht7lmP6S0rm8TwVdHfw",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.7": "以序数为索引、而非取自有限集合的真值，使证据能在每一个有限的观测阶段之后继续细化。",
  "@home.design.notes.7": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 7.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;2ducQgl3XEDOylqo5hnUYvBVgMdT6twfSMB75nY22P8",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.8": "每条记录都以其自身字节的密码学哈希来命名。相同的内容总有相同的名字，一个名字也永远无法被悄悄改指他处。",
  "@home.design.notes.8": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 8.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;yD-hURYsfr1wUaP2TXkZZNdPhlM4CJq2B7prVg-8e5M",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.9": "CALM 定理（Hellerstein 与 Alvaro，《保持 CALM》（“Keeping CALM”），2020）：结论只增不减的程序，可以在多台机器上运行而无需锁或共识，并且仍然达成一致。",
  "@home.design.notes.9": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 9.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;kghz3TuXCcpKYghpvDApXuaNZbFBLj6eivbRdeLu_14",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.10": "执行以只追加的记录留下它自己的证据。某件事是否发生，总是从记录中重新推导出来，而从不靠断言。",
  "@home.design.notes.10": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 10.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;1R5qMWGqssroZYis7SFKiUjXSeRrXCQqXSrd1i7RtN8",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.11": "循环的每一轮都可以修订该循环所依赖的方法，并遵守与其他一切相同的证据规则。",
  "@home.design.notes.11": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 11.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;Rf7vV89Iq0tiybBYV6b52rWxAL20Vs6zJTtC6XbbqWE",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.12": "自我管理：自我配置、自我修复、自我优化、自我保护。源自 IBM 2001 年的自主计算宣言。",
  "@home.design.notes.12": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 12.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;OlCYTuUqi54qF23Fuiy6QX2aZzs4PwSRHwsHTe9Fslw",
      "for": [
        {
          "role": "translator",
          "kind": "machine",
          "by": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "at": "2026-10-19T11:00:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "home.design.notes.13": "一条信道承载许多信号。在这里：一个平台在许多代理之间承载许多语言，包括自然语言、形式语言和机器语言。",
  "@home.design.notes.13": {
    "description": "The gloss of note 13.",
    "x-l-space": {
      "source": "ni:///sha-256;QgGF4UyIBrZzq4PntsUqD_hCTS-yPbzO_xH-SttanWQ",
